with who is the present at this point, I guess it's Calvin Coolidge, and I only managed to get away to attend the picnic at the last minute, would strike surely most people is laughable, but I guess a lot of people at the Kokomo picnic, like the idea that the Grand Dragon... Yeah, and he's their Grand Dragon. Yeah, it's not just anybody's Grand Dragon.
