in the state of Indiana, and the clan will sift through them all. And the data includes every opinion these people have ever expressed, their schools, their kids go to, their ethnic background, all of these kinds of things, what clubs they've joined. Then the clan makes its choice. The clan will then campaign for these people. They will get Protestant ministers to talk about them in their sermons. They will publish the approved slate in Sunday school newsletters. Klansmen will leave a special copy of the fiery cross telling you how to vote on your porch on election day. They have hundreds of cars ready to take Protestant voters to the polls. Clans women will stand ready to mind people's children so women can go and vote, all of this.
三K党会筛选所有这些数据。数据包括这些人曾经表达过的每一个观点、他们孩子上的学校、他们的种族背景、所有这些事情、他们加入的俱乐部。然后三K党做出选择。三K党随后会为这些人竞选。他们会请新教牧师在布道中谈论他们。他们会在主日学校的时事通讯中发布批准的名单。三K党成员会在选举日把一份特别的《烈焰十字》放在你的门廊上，告诉你如何投票。他们有数百辆车准备把新教选民送到投票站。三K党女性会准备好照顾人们的孩子，这样女性就可以去投票，所有这些。

