And it's a brilliant success. It is an object lesson in how political organisation in kind of local America works. because in 1924, almost every single clan candidate in Indiana is elected to office, going all the way from mayors and district attorneys to sheriffs and school boards. And Stevenson thinks to himself, well, if I can do this in Indiana, I can do this anywhere. So in his headquarters in Indianapolis, he has a bust of Napoleon. He has eight phones, including one of them which he claims is a direct line to the White House, but no one has ever allowed to lift it because it's obviously just a complete fake.
这是一个巨大的成功。这是地方美国政治组织如何运作的一个典型案例。因为在1924年，印第安纳州几乎每一个三K党候选人都当选了，从市长和地区检察官到警长和学校董事会。史蒂文森心想，好吧，如果我能在印第安纳州做到这一点，我就能在任何地方做到这一点。所以在他位于印第安纳波利斯的总部，他有一个拿破仑的半身像。他有八部电话，其中一部他声称是通往白宫的直通线，但没人被允许拿起它，因为它显然只是个彻头彻尾的假货。

92
00:46:18.000 --> 00:46:56.000
And Hicke says to his aides, I'm a nobody from nowhere, but I've got the biggest brains and I'm going to be the biggest man in the United States. And the first step to this is basically seizing control of the National Clan from the dentist. So in the summer of 1924, he declares independence from the National Clan, and he triggers this clan civil war. So it's basically Indiana is leading a revolt against Atlanta. There's a huge and very bizarre and Baroque struggle for power in which they're sort of suing each other for libel, Stevenson's local lodge is persuaded to kick him out. He accuses Hiram Evans of blowing up his yacht. I'm not sure how true that is.
他告诉他的助手，我是一个来自无名之地的无名小卒，但我有最大的头脑，我将成为美国最伟大的人。实现这一目标的第一步基本上是从牙医手中夺取全国三K党的控制权。因此，在1924年夏天，他宣布脱离全国三K党，并引发了这场三K党内战。所以基本上是印第安纳州领导了一场针对亚特兰大的反叛。这是一场巨大且非常怪异、巴洛克式的权力斗争，他们互相起诉诽谤，史蒂文森的当地分会被说服将他踢出。他指责海勒姆·埃文斯炸毁了他的游艇。我不确定这有多真实。

93
