And this struggle in summer of 1924 seems perfectly poised. So let's just pause that here because we're in the middle of 1924. And don't forget, the clan is going to try and get involved in national politics and play the part of Kingmaker. Now, the clan has already been very successful. They've elected a senator from Texas. They've worn all sorts of public offices. and states as diverse, as we talked last time, as Oregon and in the northwest and Texas,
