94
00:47:23.000 --> 00:47:42.000
right down by the Mexican border. They have probably got about 16 senators in the U.S. Senate, loyal to the clan, and about 75 congressmen in the House of Representatives, and probably 11 governors. Again, loyal to the clan. These are Linda Gordon's figures. But what they really want to do
